    "content": "<h2 id=\"%E5%9C%A8%E6%99%BA%E6%85%A7%E8%AE%B0ai%E8%BF%9B%E9%94%80%E5%AD%98%E5%95%86%E5%93%81%E6%A8%A1%E5%9D%97%E6%94%AF%E6%8C%81%E5%8D%95%E7%8B%AC%E4%B8%8A%E6%9E%B6%2F%E6%89%B9%E9%87%8F%E4%B8%8A%E6%9E%B6\" tabindex=\"-1\">在智慧记AI进销存商品模块支持单独上架/批量上架<a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#%E5%9C%A8%E6%99%BA%E6%85%A7%E8%AE%B0ai%E8%BF%9B%E9%94%80%E5%AD%98%E5%95%86%E5%93%81%E6%A8%A1%E5%9D%97%E6%94%AF%E6%8C%81%E5%8D%95%E7%8B%AC%E4%B8%8A%E6%9E%B6%2F%E6%89%B9%E9%87%8F%E4%B8%8A%E6%9E%B6\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></a></h2>\n<p>并且支持上架套餐</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://ks3-cn-beijing.ksyun.com/zhjwebsite/uploads/202405/fff49e833d827147c6b118f14bf55084.png\" alt=\"Description\"></p>\n<h2 id=\"%E7%82%B9%E5%87%BB%E5%95%86%E5%93%81%E4%BF%AE%E6%94%B9-%E5%8F%AF%E4%BB%A5%E4%BF%AE%E6%94%B9-%E8%AF%A5%E5%95%86%E5%93%81%E5%9C%A8%E4%BA%91%E5%BA%97%E7%9A%84%E4%BF%A1%E6%81%AF\" tabindex=\"-1\">点击商品修改 可以修改 该商品在云店的信息<a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#%E7%82%B9%E5%87%BB%E5%95%86%E5%93%81%E4%BF%AE%E6%94%B9-%E5%8F%AF%E4%BB%A5%E4%BF%AE%E6%94%B9-%E8%AF%A5%E5%95%86%E5%93%81%E5%9C%A8%E4%BA%91%E5%BA%97%E7%9A%84%E4%BF%A1%E6%81%AF\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></a></h2>\n<p><img src=\"https://ks3-cn-beijing.ksyun.com/zhjwebsite/uploads/202405/d65e5e2fd8c4220649f5031abbbe088d.png\" alt=\"Description\"></p>\n",
